    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "584c9fd8-9f50-4021-a6a4-a619f2ff16ee"],
 ". Show that the minimum eigenvalue degrades gracefully. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"989302f2-777f-4335-a4de-447f630e564e"],

